# Code fences in rule files and in the eval's examples are often fragments,
# with `yield*` outside a generator. A formatter that parses them rewrites
# `yield* x` as `yield * x`, a multiplication.
presets/**/*.md
.adhere/**/*.md
eval/cases/**/*.md
eval/studies/more-examples.md
# Findings on other repos quote each rule's code and each source line as the
# report printed them.
eval/repos/*/*/**/*.md
